      "title": "MiniMax H3 Director · r2v",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "PLAGUEKIND H3 V9 · CONTINUOUS UHD\n\nTwo 12-second R2V asset groups produce one continuous video. Shared params are prepended to every asset prompt; From prev and 22 context frames preserve the handoff.\n\nQuality path: 1344×768 first pass → H3 learned latent upscale and 3-step refine at 1920×1088 → RTX VSR exact 3840×2160 HIGH → RCAS 0.20 → one UHD file with native audio.\n\nFor a quick draft, bypass RTX VSR and RCAS and disconnect the Refine input. Keep FILM interpolation off for cinematic 24 fps."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
